notes.body:
The spec will include a revision to fix this as, 
1) use the most significant bit in the field Mnc to indicate whether the MNC is 2-decimal digits or 3-decimal digits; 2) if the MNC is 2-decimal digits, the 8 least 8 significant bits in field Mnc contains two BCD-encoded digits for the MNC; 3) if the MNC is 3-decimal digits, the 12 least significant bits in field Mnc contains three BCD-encoded digits for the MNC;

So I will follow this to display 2/3 digits accordingly. Let me know if it can resolve this comment. Thanks very much.

